    "content": "All 22 checklist items have been tested and recorded — **15 PASS, 7 FAIL**.\n\n## Summary of failures\n\n**Data persistence (most severe)**\n- **FT-19** — The app has no persistence layer. localStorage is empty and there's no backend (`/api/products` returns SPA HTML). Every product created or edited via admin is discarded on reload, so the core \"curate your own lists\" purpose doesn't survive a session.\n\n**Price filtering (three related defects)**\n- **FT-10 / CS-12 / IX-13** — The price slider renders only **one thumb**, so no maximum can be set despite min/max labels. Worse, the applied minimum lags one interaction behind the displayed value: at a `$810` minimum the grid still showed Dyson at `$749`. Resetting the slider to `$0` left the grid stuck at 3 products, with every control reading neutral while results reflected a stale `$810` filter — only a full reload recovered.\n\n**Tag filter list is static**\n- **FT-4** — The tag-filter list is hardcoded to the 35 seeded tags. Newly saved tags (`qa-newtag`, `mood-lighting`, `qatag-*`) never appear as filter choices, while removed tags like `ambiance` remain selectable and match 0 products. Notably, tag *search* works fine (FT-6 passed) — only the filter list is disconnected.\n\n**Category selector on category pages is inert**\n- **IX-21** — The same control works on `/products`, but on `/category/tech` selecting a different category silently reverts; URL, heading, and grid all stay unchanged.\n\n**Featured browsing incomplete**\n- **FT-2** — Marking/unmarking correctly updates the homepage strip, but that strip caps at 3 items and the \"View all\" link (`/products?featured=true`) ignores the filter entirely, listing all 10 products. With 4 items featured, the complete featured set is unreachable.\n\n**Publish validation too weak**\n- **CS-20** — Only Name and Short Description are enforced. A product with no review, image, retailer link, or specs published successfully and rendered with an empty `img src` and a dead `href=\"\"` Buy Now button — a broken, unusable recommendation.\n\n## What works well\nKeyword search (case-insensitive across names, descriptions, and tags), all four sort modes, category filtering on `/products`, multi-tag OR filtering, product creation/editing of all fields including category reassignment, detail pages with untruncated reviews and complete specs, external retailer links with proper `target=_blank rel=noopener noreferrer`, not-found states for invalid product and category IDs, and full content consistency across homepage, category, list, and detail views for all 9 seeded products.\n\nOne cosmetic note logged under FT-1: edited prices render as `$129.5` rather than `$129.50`."
  }
}
